# InfraXsky

> [!TIP]
> All supported InfraXsky models can be found [here](https://huggingface.co/models?inference_provider=infraxsky&sort=trending)

{{{logoSection}}}

{{{followUsSection}}}

InfraXsky is an independent inference provider serving open-weight chat models on
dedicated NVIDIA GPUs through an OpenAI-compatible API, with streaming, tool calling
and structured output. Prompts and completions are never stored or used for training.

